00:45:09,642 --> 00:45:12,745
Of course, I do not know who,
but I know which...

998
00:45:12,778 --> 00:45:16,782
Which way they went.

999
00:45:16,815 --> 00:45:19,050
Well?

1000
00:45:19,083 --> 00:45:23,688
The same road Lisa took, master,
to the other side.

1001
00:45:23,722 --> 00:45:25,123
[Imitates kissing]

1002
00:45:25,157 --> 00:45:26,858
You smell like a fresh cookie.

1003
00:45:26,892 --> 00:45:28,960
- To anatolia.
- Yes.

1004
00:45:28,993 --> 00:45:30,895
You're dripping sweat on me.

1005
00:45:30,928 --> 00:45:34,398
Ahmed!
Reward him.

1006
00:45:34,433 --> 00:45:38,670
Oh, someone's got
an oily t-zone.

1007
00:45:38,703 --> 00:45:39,672
Where's his reward?

1008
00:45:39,705 --> 00:45:40,905
[Screaming]

1009
00:45:40,938 --> 00:45:43,108
No, no, I meant give him
a slice of pie.

1010
00:45:43,142 --> 00:45:45,043
I'm so wasted,
I forgot what he said.

1011
00:45:45,077 --> 00:45:48,447
- Always.
- No, never.

1012
00:45:48,480 --> 00:45:51,550
Ugh.

1013
00:45:51,583 --> 00:45:54,653
Oh, it's the Istanbul
orkin man.

1014
00:45:54,687 --> 00:45:57,790
Hmm.

1015
00:45:57,823 --> 00:45:59,925
I'd say this movie
has less action

1016
00:45:59,958 --> 00:46:02,527
